  "Validation": "Eight installer controls passed on Windows and Ubuntu WSL. Legacy broad-rule detector failed before removal then passed. On hardware, both selected USB4 profiles moved to Private, both exact peer ICMPv6 rules read back in the effective store, and all four directional echo series passed 12/12. The original canary rollback restored both categories. The shared-scope rollback controls use inert providers."
